Third-party components

Rust crates compiled into the native binaries and WebAssembly modules are
listed, with their license texts, in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.

Models are downloaded at runtime and are not included in this distribution:

  lightonai/LateOn-Code                            Apache-2.0
  lightonai/LateOn-Code-edge                       Apache-2.0
  Alibaba-NLP/gte-reranker-modernbert-base         Apache-2.0
  nomic-ai/CodeRankEmbed and its ONNX conversions  MIT

`sweet-search init` changes the system prompt of Claude Code, Codex and
opencode. See scripts/harness-prompts/NOTICE.md for sources and changes.

All three prompts are modified versions of the harness's own prompt:

  Claude Code
  Adapted from the system prompt of Claude Code, Anthropic PBC.
